    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-γηράσκω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γεγήρακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					217
				</span></i>
			:—<i>grow old with</i> or <i>together</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπη ἀπόρῳ ς. βίῳ</span>
			<i>lasts to the end of</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Kith.Fr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; of fast colours, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῷ εἰρίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.203
				</span></i>
			; of a morbid growth, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				776a5
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. οἱ ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Carn.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.116
			</span></i>.</div>
